{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Sketchy Bee 🐝","id":"297577343554158603","is_bot":0,"username":"sketchybee"},"author_id":"297577343554158603","channel_id":"739055666651463691","content":"Leaf nods solemnly. \"I don't know how he and his brother got that way, but I hope things will be different now.\" She thinks to the words she left on the cornerstone. \"Oh, I didn't understand the plan all that well but sure!\"","created_at":"2020-08-17T23:59:18.310000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"745069276813197374","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"schrödingers dumbass","id":"264570136025890816","is_bot":0,"username":"greylikessharks"},"author_id":"264570136025890816","channel_id":"739055666651463691","content":"“Did Hiram mention any reasoning he had, for why he thought his plan would work? It’s just, the knights have come to the opposite conclusion as him. I don’t want to discredit him though. He’s was a genius. I was just wondering if he had evidence or a journal or something that would give his reasoning.”","created_at":"2020-08-18T00:01:54.050000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"745069930033971221","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
