{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Sketchy Bee 🐝","id":"297577343554158603","is_bot":0,"username":"sketchybee"},"author_id":"297577343554158603","channel_id":"739055666651463691","content":"\"I... I'm not sure.\" Leaf taps her foot a bit nervously. \"I brought up working with the knights earlier, and John said we'd have to make a choice. I suppose this is probably what he was talking about. We're supposed to talk to Dregen, so I'll do my best to figure out the reasoning. We both want the same thing, so its strange that we've both got such different solutions...\"","created_at":"2020-08-18T00:11:11.163000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"745072266735255592","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
